---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About FileLocker — Who We Are and Why We Built This"
  description="FileLocker is a Windows desktop application for protecting sensitive files before delivery. Built to solve the real-world problem of secure document handoff for professionals."
>
  <Navbar currentPath="/about" />

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow center">About</div>
      <h1>We built what we couldn't find.</h1>
      <p>A simple, trustworthy way to protect sensitive files before handing them to a client.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">What is FileLocker?</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px,2.8vw,32px);margin-bottom:24px;">A secure file delivery application.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--color-ink-soft);margin-bottom:20px;">FileLocker is a secure file delivery application for professionals who need to protect sensitive documents before handing them to clients or other recipients.</p>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--color-ink-soft);margin-bottom:20px;">Files are protected locally using AES-256-GCM encryption. The resulting locked file can be delivered through email, USB drives, or other transfer methods. Recipients don't need to install the FileLocker desktop application to unlock their files.</p>
      
      <div style="background:#F7F9FC; border:1px solid #E2E8F0; border-radius:8px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:40px;">
        <h3 style="font-size:16px; margin-bottom:12px;">Product Identity</h3>
        <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; font-size:14px; color:var(--color-ink-soft);">
          <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Product:</strong> FileLocker</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Website:</strong> filelocker.online</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Category:</strong> Secure file delivery / file protection</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Platform:</strong> Windows desktop application</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Recipient:</strong> Browser-based unlock</li>
          <li><strong>Business model:</strong> One-time purchase</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="eyebrow">The problem</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px,2.8vw,32px);margin-bottom:24px;">Professionals share sensitive files every day without meaningful protection.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--color-ink-soft);margin-bottom:20px;">A lawyer hands a client a USB drive with their case files. An accountant emails a tax return. A photographer delivers wedding photos. A healthcare provider shares patient records. In most of these cases, the files are completely unprotected — readable by anyone who intercepts them, finds the drive, or gets forwarded the email by accident.</p>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--color-ink-soft);margin-bottom:40px;">The problem isn't that these professionals are careless. The existing tools weren't designed for this workflow. FileLocker solves this locally without requiring cloud storage or complex software installation for recipients.</p>

      <div class="eyebrow">Contact</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px,2.8vw,32px);margin-bottom:24px;">Get in touch.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--color-ink-soft);margin-bottom:20px;">For support, questions, or feedback about FileLocker:</p>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--color-ink);">Email: <a href="mailto:support@filelocker.online" style="color:var(--color-navy);">support@filelocker.online</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="final-cta">
        <h2>Join Early Access.</h2>
        <p>FileLocker is preparing for its public launch. Be among the first to use it.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px;">
          <a href="/early-access" class="btn btn-primary">Join Early Access &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
